{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>作為參照，不到一周前的預購估算數字還是969萬份。相關信息還稱，本作此前已成為PlayStation和Xbox商店預購量最高的遊戲，但並未提供兩家平台各自的官方榜單原始頁面。</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"外媒估算《GTA6》主機預購量約1588萬份\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261118/1794949588_872981.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>Sensor Tower同時預測，《GTA6》發售後的一個月內，其他遊戲的日活躍玩家總量可能下降10%或更多。該機構將這一預測與《怪物獵人：荒野》推出後一個月帶來的7.6%降幅進行比較。</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"外媒估算《GTA6》主機預購量約1588萬份\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261118/1794949588_750739.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>上述預購份數、收入、平台佔比及玩家活躍度變化均為Sensor Tower的統計或預測，並非Rockstar、Take-Two、索尼或微軟公開確認的財務數據。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T23:22:20.399782+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":260,"images":2,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T23:02:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T18:57:54.216318+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T23:15:49.472493+00:00","content_hash":"d742fb02912545bdcbfb9587cafdc0ff01ca20f0e0201ef0eac18794978beff5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}